  "helpfulness": "equally helpful",
  "helpfulness_justification": "Both teams signed a complete five-section document that protects both red lines, but the 8% testing limit and 6-year retrofit window favour Northwind more than the 36-month suppression date and no-ban remedy favour Halcyon.",
  "conflict_styles": {
   "Northwind-researcher": "collaborating",
   "Northwind-drafter": "compromising",
   "Northwind-negotiator": "competing",
   "Halcyon-researcher": "collaborating",
